# SAM3X8E boot/connect smoke test. The local sam3x8e.repl is the
# only path - Renode upstream has no SAM3X platform and no SAM3-
# specific peripheral models. The repl reuses the SAM4S_EEFC model
# (EEFC register layout is family-uniform across SAM3X / SAM4S /
# SAM4E) and the PMC_SR flipflop pattern. Both sam3x8c and sam3x8e
# point at this same repl in renode_launcher.py so the test exercises
# the shared path. printers.test reaches sam3x8e via radds + alligator
# / archim2 boards, but only at config-parse depth; this is the
# end-to-end firmware-boot regression target.
DICTIONARY sam3x8e.dict
CONFIG sam3x_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR sam3x_smoke.fixture.json

# A few harmless gcode lines so klippy gets past klippy:ready.
M114
M105
M105
M105

# klippy connected and stayed connected long enough to do the
# clocksync handshake against the firmware's generic/armcm_timer view.
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
